   "lines": [
    "I had a long talk",
    "with Uncle Jim",
    "about my future",
    "life; I have absolute-",
    "-ly no idea what",
    "I shall do when",
    "I leave college.",
    "Oh, Father, my",
    "Father no words",
    "can tell how I",
    "shall miss your",
    "counsel and ad-",
    "-vice!",
    "However for the next",
    "two years my duty is",
    "clear - to study well",
    "and live like a brave",
    "Christian gentleman"
   ],
